    "description": "Demiurge agent: RAG, graph context, tools. LLMAgent → ProcessAgent → ApplyEdits (comments/todos). Supports report, run_workflow, grep, formulas_calc, delegate_request (chat handoff). Chat via run_agent_workflow()."
